        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PH60, Solid Brass Pivot Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana PH60 has a build-in needle bearing for higher weight capacity--up to 200 lbs! The universal design of the Heavy Duty Fixed Pivot Hinge Solid Brass means that it can be easily handed. Comes packaged with matching finish #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PH60-Specifications.gif?v=1704354511\" width=\"547\" height=\"291\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PH60 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/fixed-pivot-hinge-for-doors-up-35-lbs-deltana-ph35\"><b>Pivot Hinges for Doors Up to 35 lbs</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/fixed-pivot-hinge-for-doors-up-70-lbs-deltana-ph40\"><b>Pivot Hinges for Doors Up to 70 lbs</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Heavy Duty Brass Pivot Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Size: 4-3/8\" x 5/8\" x 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Load Capacity: 200 LB.</li>\r\n<li>Built-in needle bearing for higher weight capacity.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Handing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PH60.pdf?v=1704262215\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PH60 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PH60-pivot-hinge-install-instructions.pdf?v=1691095384\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PH60 Hinge Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse with the <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-pivot-hinge-base-deltana-pb985\"><b>Pivot Hinge Base</b></a> for tile and stone floors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
